rg/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M208,96l-80,80L48,96Z\" opacity=\"0.2\"></path><path d=\"M215.39,92.94A8,8,0,0,0,208,88H48a8,8,0,0,0-5.66,13.66l80,80a8,8,0,0,0,11.32,0l80-80A8,8,0,0,0,215.39,92.94ZM128,164.69,67.31,104H188.69Z\"></path></svg></summary><p>Choose Recharge now on your connection strip. Your operator and subscriber ID are prefilled; review the pack and amount before paying.</p></details><details><summary><span>What if I was debited but the recharge is pending?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M208,96l-80,80L48,96Z\" opacity=\"0.2\"></path><path d=\"M215.39,92.94A8,8,0,0,0,208,88H48a8,8,0,0,0-5.66,13.66l80,80a8,8,0,0,0,11.32,0l80-80A8,8,0,0,0,215.39,92.94ZM128,164.69,67.31,104H188.69Z\"></path></svg></summary><p>Do not pay again immediately. Check payment and recharge status separately in Recharge history, and contact support with the reference.</p></details><details><summary><span>Are packs available for every operator?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M208,96l-80,80L48,96Z\" opacity=\"0.2\"></path><path d=\"M215.39,92.94A8,8,0,0,0,208,88H48a8,8,0,0,0-5.66,13.66l80,80a8,8,0,0,0,11.32,0l80-80A8,8,0,0,0,215.39,92.94ZM128,164.69,67.31,104H188.69Z\"></path></svg></summary><p>Pack availability varies by operator. Where offered, use a custom top-up if no pack catalogue is available. Check the details before confirming.</p></details><button type=\"button\" class=\"launch-faq-toggle\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"home-faqs\">View more</button></div></div><div class=\"launch-bottom-cta\"><h3>Ready to choose your connection?</h3><a href=\"/new-connection\" data-discover=\"true\">Explore new connections</a></div></section>","ta":"<link